 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！还记得第三十七集的农场吗？今天，我们再去乡下走一走！"
    },
    {
     "en": "countryside"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:farm",
    "focus:farm"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "农场："
    },
    {
     "en": "farm"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:field",
    "edge:farm>field",
    "focus:field"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "农场旁边一大片田地："
    },
    {
     "en": "field"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:plants",
    "edge:field>plants",
    "focus:plants"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "田里种着各种各样的植物："
    },
    {
     "en": "plants"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:kind",
    "edge:plants>kind",
    "focus:kind"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "一种、一类，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "kind"
    },
    {
     "zh": "常常这样说：",
     "cue": [
      "alt:kind"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "a kind of plant"
    },
    {
     "zh": "小提示：它还有一个意思，是善良的。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wheat",
    "edge:plants>wheat",
    "focus:wheat"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "金黄的小麦："
    },
    {
     "en": "wheat"
    },
    {
     "zh": "面包和面条，都是小麦做的哦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:corn",
    "edge:wheat>corn",
    "focus:corn"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "一粒一粒黄黄的玉米："
    },
    {
     "en": "corn"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:cotton",
    "edge:wheat>cotton",
    "focus:cotton"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "白白软软的棉花："
    },
    {
     "en": "cotton"
    },
    {
     "en": "Corn, wheat and cotton are three kinds of plants."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:pick",
    "edge:cotton>pick",
    "focus:pick"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "棉花熟了，要去摘："
    },
    {
     "en": "pick"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's pick cotton."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:water",
    "focus:water"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "植物要喝水，我们要给它浇水。水这个词，也可以当动词用："
    },
    {
     "en": "water"
    },
    {
     "en": "Water the corn in the morning."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:live",
    "edge:water>live",
    "focus:live"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "浇了水，植物就能活下来："
    },
    {
     "en": "live"
    },
    {
     "zh": "活着的，是",
     "cue": [
      "alt:live"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "alive"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:die",
    "edge:water>die",
    "focus:die"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "忘了浇水，植物就会死掉："
    },
    {
     "en": "die"
    },
    {
     "zh": "死了的，是",
     "cue": [
      "alt:die"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "dead"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wood",
    "edge:farm>wood",
    "focus:wood"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "农场后面，有一片树林："
    },
    {
     "en": "wood"
    },
    {
     "zh": "树林常常说成",
     "cue": [
      "alt:wood"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "the woods"
    },
    {
     "zh": "这个词也是木头的意思。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:duck",
    "edge:wood>duck",
    "focus:duck"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "树林边的小河里，鸭子在游泳："
    },
    {
     "en": "duck"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:rabbit",
    "edge:wood>rabbit",
    "focus:rabbit"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "草丛里，蹦出来一只小兔子："
    },
    {
     "en": "rabbit"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:spider",
    "edge:duck>spider",
    "focus:spider"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "树枝上，蜘蛛在织网："
    },
    {
     "en": "spider"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:live,die"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "活着和死去，正好相反："
    },
    {
     "en": "live, alive",
     "cue": [
      "focus:live"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "die, dead",
     "cue": [
      "focus:die"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "你在乡下看到了什么？"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [],
   "parts": [
    {
     "en": "I see a duck.",
     "cue": [
